    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Subject</strong> is an intense single-player FPS action game that thrusts you into the role of an ordinary individual caught in an extraordinary situation. One moment you're living your life, the next you're abducted by beings not of this world. With no choice but to fight, you must rely on your wits, fists, and the power-ups you scavenge to escape a labyrinthine alien ship teeming with danger. Every fight is a test of your strength, resilience, and determination to regain your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core mechanics</strong> of the game are vaulting over obstacles and punching aliens</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.poster.avif?t=1734442598\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.webm?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.mp4?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles are required in order to progress through the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.poster.avif?t=1734442598\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.webm?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.mp4?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Progression and Saving System:</strong><br>The game features five distinct levels, each designed to challenge your skills and determination. Levels must be completed sequentially\u2014finish one to unlock the next. Along the way, you can collect power-ups that enhance your abilities. These power-ups will be permanently saved once you complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re defeated before reaching the end of a level, you\u2019ll restart from the beginning of that level. The game employs an automatic save system that records your progress at the end of each level, ensuring you can pick up where you left off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Subject</strong> is an intense single-player FPS action game that thrusts you into the role of an ordinary individual caught in an extraordinary situation. One moment you're living your life, the next you're abducted by beings not of this world. With no choice but to fight, you must rely on your wits, fists, and the power-ups you scavenge to escape a labyrinthine alien ship teeming with danger. Every fight is a test of your strength, resilience, and determination to regain your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core mechanics</strong> of the game are vaulting over obstacles and punching aliens</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.poster.avif?t=1734442598\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.webm?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/80578b9acd215499d5468564a45e0604.mp4?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles are required in order to progress through the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.poster.avif?t=1734442598\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.webm?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377390/extras/867fde497dd5cc4d5aa0d71e89296d80.mp4?t=1734442598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Progression and Saving System:</strong><br>The game features five distinct levels, each designed to challenge your skills and determination. Levels must be completed sequentially\u2014finish one to unlock the next. Along the way, you can collect power-ups that enhance your abilities. These power-ups will be permanently saved once you complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re defeated before reaching the end of a level, you\u2019ll restart from the beginning of that level. The game employs an automatic save system that records your progress at the end of each level, ensuring you can pick up where you left off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
